OL,3,GNEWSAThree men jailed for plot to
OL,4,Asupply cocaine as part of investigation
OL,5,Ainto UDA
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree County Antrim men have been
OL,8,Fjailed for the roles they played in a
OL,9,Fplot to supply cocaine.
OL,11,FThe trio from Greenisland were among
OL,12,Fsix men arrested following a covert
OL,13,Fpolice operation in November 2020.
OL,15,FClifford George Irons (49) from
OL,16,FShannagh Avenue played a leading role
OL,17,Fin the criminal enterprise and was
OL,18,Fhanded a six-year sentence.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
